1
00:00:07,560 --> 00:00:09,699
(Final Episode) I need to tell my
parents I'm moving out of the apartment.

2
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,359
Right now!?

3
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,440
So suddenly?

4
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,400
Mom, I'm doing great.

5
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,240
Well...

6
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,700
I found someone I want to live with.

7
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:35,500
(Call ended)

8
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,300
Ah!

9
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:41,840
This might be more nerve-wracking
than any business negotiation.

10
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:43,799
Does this bother you?

11
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:45,279
Am I rushing things?

12
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,820
No, I'll make sure to
introduce myself properly.

13
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,620
Let me proudly show you off.

14
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,240
Just like you did for me.

15
00:00:57,080 --> 00:00:59,560
I want to be someone who
can show off Okumi-san too.

16
00:01:01,660 --> 00:01:02,820
Ai-chan.

17
00:01:29,740 --> 00:01:30,740
Everything.

18
00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:33,300
Everything about you.

19
00:01:34,320 --> 00:01:35,320
It's all mine.

20
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,160
So...

21
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,220
Don't go anywhere.

22
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,080
I'm right here with you.

23
00:01:45,340 --> 00:01:46,540
I'm not going anywhere.

24
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:00,519
Sorry to keep you waiting.

25
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:01,610
- Thank you.
- Here you go.

26
00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:09,020
I...

27
00:02:09,021 --> 00:02:10,600
My name is Okumi Hideaki.

28
00:02:12,040 --> 00:02:14,680
I apologize for dropping by
so unexpectedly.

29
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,500
I'm truly sorry.

30
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:22,400
We heard you were living together,
but we didn't expect someone so handsome.

31
00:02:23,500 --> 00:02:26,420
As for your age, are you
about the same age as us?

32
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,200
Oh, age doesn't matter, right?

33
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:31,020
Yeah, as long as it doesn't matter.

34
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:35,380
If you don't mind me asking,
what do you do for a living?

35
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:36,580
Ah, excuse me.

36
00:02:36,581 --> 00:02:38,060
Oh, okay.

37
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:40,820
I... Here is my business card.

38
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:43,080
Okay, let me take a look.

39
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:48,269
General Manager?

40
00:02:48,270 --> 00:02:49,879
It's just a coincidence.
Really, just a coincidence.

41
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:52,960
Yes, I don't interfere with HR matters.

42
00:02:53,060 --> 00:02:54,580
That's amazing.

43
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,499
It really feels like destiny.

44
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:58,339
Isn't this too much of a coincidence?

45
00:02:58,340 --> 00:02:59,419
He is a General Manager, after all.

46
00:02:59,420 --> 00:03:00,819
Mom, wait a second.

47
00:03:00,820 --> 00:03:03,619
What's wrong? Did I say something bad?

48
00:03:03,620 --> 00:03:05,239
Okumi-san.

49
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,240
Ah.

50
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,160
I'm sorry.

51
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:14,360
I'm truly sorry for taking so long
to come and introduce myself.

52
00:03:15,900 --> 00:03:19,980
Ainosuke and I are in
a serious relationship.

53
00:03:21,580 --> 00:03:23,560
You mean a romantic relationship?

54
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,360
- Yes.
- That's right.

55
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:28,900
So I wanted you to meet him.

56
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:31,740
Anyway...

57
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,040
He is my partner.

58
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:51,320
Forgive my bluntness, but have
you considered the age gap?

59
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,220
I have.

60
00:03:57,740 --> 00:04:00,000
I completely understand your concerns.

61
00:04:01,360 --> 00:04:02,360
Therefore...

62
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:05,400
I'm also mentally prepared
for the day we might have to part ways.

63
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,140
Huh?

64
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:09,540
How dare you!

65
00:04:10,340 --> 00:04:13,259
How could we ever hand our Ainosuke
over to a man like you!

66
00:04:13,260 --> 00:04:14,860
Mom, calm down.

67
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:18,119
You don't have any resolve at all!

68
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,359
No, it's not that I lack resolve.

69
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,680
Time out.

70
00:04:23,740 --> 00:04:25,000
But...

71
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,380
He says he understands our concerns...

72
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,300
And then talks about being
prepared to break up. Honestly!

73
00:04:32,960 --> 00:04:34,660
- You get it, right?
- I get it.

74
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,699
I understand. My wife was out of line.

75
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:37,700
Not at all.

76
00:04:38,480 --> 00:04:41,800
But I feel the exact same way.

77
00:04:42,680 --> 00:04:44,460
You say you want to live together...

78
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:48,520
But you're talking with a breakup in mind.
What is that supposed to mean?

79
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:58,480
To me, Ainosuke is
an irreplaceable presence.

80
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:06,980
He is an absolutely wonderful person.

81
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:11,840
It's not that I wouldn't
care if we broke up.

82
00:05:13,380 --> 00:05:15,300
Precisely because I don't
want that to happen...

83
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:20,060
I believe I have to keep working hard
so we can stay together.

84
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,240
However...

85
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:27,280
Just as you mentioned,
there is a significant age gap between us.

86
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:38,580
I don't want to become a stumbling block
in Ainosuke's future.

87
00:05:39,620 --> 00:05:40,640
So...

88
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:46,540
If Ainosuke ever decides
to take a different path...

89
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,560
If that day comes...

90
00:05:51,950 --> 00:05:54,380
I want to be the one
who pushes him forward.

91
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:57,100
That kind of presence.

92
00:06:06,580 --> 00:06:14,580
When this child was born, he was so tiny.
He only weighed 800 grams.

93
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:21,760
At the time, his heart and lungs were in a
condition that might have required surgery.

94
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,840
Back then, I thought to myself...

95
00:06:26,460 --> 00:06:28,280
As long as he survives, that's enough.

96
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,540
Not hurting anyone...

97
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,720
And not being hurt by anyone.

98
00:06:35,180 --> 00:06:37,940
If possible, I hoped he
wouldn't get any serious illnesses.

99
00:06:39,140 --> 00:06:41,260
As long as Ainosuke can live happily...

100
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,680
I couldn't ask for anything more.

101
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:52,120
Even if his partner is a man
who is older than him...

102
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:57,140
As long as Ainosuke is
happy, that's all that matters.

103
00:06:59,380 --> 00:07:00,820
Right, Mom?

104
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:07,120
I'm so sorry for my rude behavior earlier.

105
00:07:09,540 --> 00:07:10,560
It's completely fine.

106
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,840
Because I am fully prepared for this.

107
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:39,020
Nice to meet you.

108
00:07:40,060 --> 00:07:41,460
I'm Hizaki Ainosuke.

109
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:04,420
You sure come here often.

110
00:08:07,260 --> 00:08:08,320
And who is this?

111
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,020
I'm...

112
00:08:13,180 --> 00:08:15,720
It's almost the 13th
anniversary of her passing, right?

113
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,970
So I wanted to visit before then.

114
00:08:18,070 --> 00:08:21,000
We'll handle the memorial service,
so please don't worry about it.

115
00:08:22,900 --> 00:08:23,900
Understood.

116
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,920
Honestly, I knew better...

117
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,440
But I couldn't help giving him a hard time.

118
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:46,540
Just wait a little longer.

119
00:08:53,180 --> 00:08:55,480
I'll go with you to pay
respects to your wife again.

120
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:59,490
I hope your feelings
will reach her someday.

121
00:09:01,300 --> 00:09:02,300
Thank you.

122
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,140
After all, she's important to Okumi-san.

123
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:10,700
You also let me go
and introduce myself to your parents.

124
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:12,399
Thank you.

125
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:14,700
Even though it was super nerve-wracking.

126
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,180
That just shows how
deeply they cherish you.

127
00:09:19,780 --> 00:09:25,580
You were raised as your
parents' precious treasure.

128
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:29,760
I was the one who wanted
to introduce you to them.

129
00:09:30,120 --> 00:09:31,840
Because we're going to be together forever.

130
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,060
I want to cherish Okumi-san properly.

131
00:09:36,360 --> 00:09:41,000
By the way, you talked about being prepared to
break up. Do you really think we'll break up?

132
00:09:41,300 --> 00:09:42,600
I'm sorry.

133
00:09:42,660 --> 00:09:44,860
But I don't want to tie you down.

134
00:09:46,160 --> 00:09:49,600
If I said tomorrow that I wanted to break
up, could you just say, "Okay, I understand"?

135
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:53,540
Well... I probably couldn't do that.

136
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,580
I couldn't do it either.

137
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,880
I want to be with you forever.

138
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,130
By the way...

139
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:21,040
You don't have to decide right now.

140
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:26,340
If you really want to be
with me forever...

141
00:10:27,620 --> 00:10:28,840
Then put this on.

142
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:29,880
This ring.

143
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:33,499
Ai-chan, Ai-chan.

144
00:10:33,500 --> 00:10:34,840
Hurry up and give me your hand.

145
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:36,249
Are you even listening to me?

146
00:10:36,250 --> 00:10:37,440
I'm listening.

147
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:41,280
Didn't I say we'll definitely be together?

148
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:46,600
This isn't going according to plan at all.

149
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:49,440
It's full of unexpected surprises.

150
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:52,540
I was planning to put it on you myself.

151
00:10:53,700 --> 00:10:54,740
Should I take it off then?

152
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,760
I won't let you get away.

153
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:16,640
Hmm?

154
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:08,940
Don't ever leave me.

155
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:13,320
You don't even have to say
it. I'm not going anywhere.

156
00:12:49,300 --> 00:12:50,480
It really is love.

157
00:12:58,340 --> 00:13:01,380
Time to dig into these soft buttocks.

158
00:13:03,740 --> 00:13:04,740
You dirty old man.

159
00:13:05,580 --> 00:13:06,840
You know you love it.

160
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:26,000
"Are the Sexy Buttocks Not Good?"
